0.0 0.106 0.58 rg 36 718 523.28 1.5 re f
BT /F2 11 Tf 0.0 0.106 0.58 rg 36 724 Td (1. Executive Summary & Business Problem) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 36 704 Td (As consumer travel booking transitions from manual web searches to autonomous AI agents \(e.g., MakeMyTrip bots, Expedia concierges,) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 36 693 Td (and Google Gemini personal assistants\), commercial airlines face an unprecedented governance challenge. Autonomous agents can search,) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 0.15 0.18 0.22 rg 36 682 Td (book, modify, and cancel flights on behalf of passengers. While frictionless, this introduces critical operational and commercial risks:) Tj ET
BT /F2 8 Tf 0.0 0.106 0.58 rg 46 668 Td (\(o\) Financial Risk & Hallucination Exposure:) Tj /F1 8 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.2 rg ( Agents may misinterpret intent or hallucinate booking criteria, causing unexpected charges.) Tj ET
BT /F2 8 Tf 0.0 0.106 0.58 rg 46 657 Td (\(o\) Operational & Itinerary Disruption:) Tj /F1 8 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.2 rg ( Arbitrary schedule changes disrupt itineraries, risk missed connections, and incur airline fees.) Tj ET
BT /F2 8 Tf 0.0 0.106 0.58 rg 46 646 Td (\(o\) Irreversible Inventory Depletion:) Tj /F1 8 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.2 rg ( Cancellations and refunds release airline seat inventory and trigger payouts, demanding strict oversight.) Tj ET
0.95 0.96 0.98 rg 36 618 523.28 32 re f
0.8 0.84 0.88 RG 0.75 w 36 618 523.28 32 re S
BT /F2 7.5 Tf 0.6 0.2 0.0 rg 44 638 Td (EDUCATIONAL SIMULATION NOTICE:) Tj /F1 7.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.25 rg ( This project is an educational simulation developed strictly for academic evaluation.) Tj ET
BT /F1 7.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.25 rg 44 627 Td (It operates in a local sandboxed environment. No real airline reservation systems \(PSS/GDS\), live inventory, or banking gateways are touched.) Tj ET
Q
q
0.0 0.106 0.58 rg 36 596 523.28 1.5 re f
BT /F2 11 Tf 0.0 0.106 0.58 rg 36 602 Td (2. Project Objectives) Tj ET
BT /F2 8 Tf 0.0 0.106 0.58 rg 46 583 Td (\(o\) Tri-State Deterministic Governance:) Tj /F1 8 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.2 rg ( Classify all inbound AI agent requests into ALLOW, ASK CUSTOMER, or BLOCK.) Tj ET
BT /F2 8 Tf 0.0 0.106 0.58 rg 46 571.5 Td (\(o\) Pre-Approved Spending Controls:) Tj /F1 8 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.2 rg ( Automate low-risk transactions while holding bookings above an initial limit of Rs. 8,000.) Tj ET
BT /F2 8 Tf 0.0 0.106 0.58 rg 46 560 Td (\(o\) Mandatory Human-in-the-Loop:) Tj /F1 8 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.2 rg ( Enforce explicit passenger confirmation on all flight changes and refund requests.) Tj ET
BT /F2 8 Tf 0.0 0.106 0.58 rg 46 548.5 Td (\(o\) Agent Governance & Kill-Switch:) Tj /F1 8 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.2 rg ( Provide one-click administrative revocation of compromised agents with permanent timestamps.) Tj ET
BT /F2 8 Tf 0.0 0.106 0.58 rg 46 537 Td (\(o\) Regulatory Auditability:) Tj /F1 8 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.2 rg ( Maintain an immutable, permanent SQLite audit log guaranteeing non-repudiation and compliance.) Tj ET
Q
q
0.0 0.106 0.58 rg 36 533 523.28 1.5 re f
BT /F2 11 Tf 0.0 0.106 0.58 rg 36 539 Td (3. How the Gatekeeper Works \(Four-Stage Policy Evaluation Flow\)) Tj ET
BT /F2 8 Tf 0.0 0.106 0.58 rg 46 520 Td (Step 1 - Identity & Status Verification:) Tj /F1 8 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.2 rg ( Gatekeeper checks agent directory. If status is REVOKED or SUSPENDED, request is instantly BLOCKED.) Tj ET
BT /F2 8 Tf 0.0 0.106 0.58 rg 46 508.5 Td (Step 2 - Permission Scope Verification:) Tj /F1 8 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.2 rg ( Verifies agent has active scope for the action \(View Fares, Book, Change, Refund\). If missing, request is BLOCKED.) Tj ET
BT /F2 8 Tf 0.0 0.106 0.58 rg 46 497 Td (Step 3 - Risk Matrix & Threshold Evaluation:) Tj /F1 8 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.2 rg ( Fares: ALLOW \(read-only\). Bookings <= Rs. 8,000: ALLOW. Bookings > Rs. 8,000: ASK CUSTOMER. Changes & Refunds: strictly ASK CUSTOMER.) Tj ET
BT /F2 8 Tf 0.0 0.106 0.58 rg 46 485.5 Td (Step 4 - Customer Confirmation & Audit:) Tj /F1 8 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.2 rg ( Pending requests enter passenger inbox. Approval/Rejection updates simulated state and appends immutable audit log.) Tj ET
