BT /F2 10.5 Tf 0.0 0.106 0.58 rg 36 745 Td (5. Key Functional Modules \(The 4 Dashboard Tabs\)) Tj ET
BT /F2 7.5 Tf 0.0 0.106 0.58 rg 46 728 Td (\(o\) Tab 1 - Live Agent Simulator:) Tj /F1 7.5 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.2 rg ( Dispatch simulated requests across all 4 actions; observe real-time ALLOW, ASK, or BLOCK verdict cards.) Tj ET
BT /F2 7.5 Tf 0.0 0.106 0.58 rg 46 718 Td (\(o\) Tab 2 - Confirmation Inbox:) Tj /F1 7.5 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.2 rg ( Human-in-the-loop passenger inbox where held actions are reviewed and confirmed with Approve/Reject buttons.) Tj ET
BT /F2 7.5 Tf 0.0 0.106 0.58 rg 46 708 Td (\(o\) Tab 3 - Governance & Kill-Switch:) Tj /F1 7.5 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.2 rg ( Onboard new customer AI agents, configure action scopes, and invoke the one-click emergency revocation switch.) Tj ET
BT /F2 7.5 Tf 0.0 0.106 0.58 rg 46 698 Td (\(o\) Tab 4 - Audit Log & Analytics:) Tj /F1 7.5 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.2 rg ( Searchable immutable transaction ledger with decision distribution chart and one-click CSV compliance export.) Tj ET
