BT /F2 10.5 Tf 0.0 0.106 0.58 rg 36 525.5 Td (7. Strategic MBA Takeaways & Conclusion) Tj ET
BT /F2 7.5 Tf 0.0 0.106 0.58 rg 46 508.5 Td (\(o\) Risk-Calibrated Automation:) Tj /F1 7.5 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.2 rg ( Full automation introduces dispute liability; zero automation eliminates AI utility. Rs. 8,000 balances both.) Tj ET
BT /F2 7.5 Tf 0.0 0.106 0.58 rg 46 498.5 Td (\(o\) Zero-Trust Architecture:) Tj /F1 7.5 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.2 rg ( Airlines cannot grant open API access to external agents. Every transaction must be validated against real-time status.) Tj ET
BT /F2 7.5 Tf 0.0 0.106 0.58 rg 46 488.5 Td (\(o\) Non-Repudiation & Auditability:) Tj /F1 7.5 Tf 0.2 0.2 0.2 rg ( Permanent SQLite audit trails record AI intent vs. human authorization, ensuring legal defensibility under DPDP.) Tj ET
